WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.018 --> 00:00:15.720
worked as fast as he could in the bunny rabbits' area.

2
00:00:17.241 --> 00:00:20.424
Just as he finished sweeping, the gym went quiet.

3
00:00:21.125 --> 00:00:23.026
Miss Bungle was making an announcement.

4
00:00:23.046 --> 00:00:29.172
"Our pet tricks competition will start in five minutes," she said.

5
00:00:29.644 --> 00:00:32.605
"Pets and trainers, please line up now.

6
00:00:33.465 --> 00:00:36.946
Everyone else, please take a seat in the viewing area."

7
00:00:37.766 --> 00:00:39.267
Ben hurried toward the stage.

8
00:00:40.767 --> 00:00:45.729
He had to find Waldo and Sid, but he didn't want to miss Winnie and Inky's performance.

9
00:00:46.549 --> 00:00:48.869
Luckily, Winnie was first in line.

10
00:00:49.310 --> 00:00:52.591
Clutching Inky, she flashed Ben a nervous smile.

11
00:00:53.171 --> 00:00:57.472
Then she headed for the stage, where three judges sat at a long table.

12
00:00:58.452 --> 00:01:01.193
"Tell us about your pet," the first judge said.

13
00:01:01.213 --> 00:01:04.575
"Well Winnie smiled, petting Inky.

14
00:01:04.595 --> 00:01:08.137
"I've been training her ever since I got her for my birthday.

15
00:01:08.557 --> 00:01:11.138
She's still young, but she's learned a lot of cool tricks."

16
00:01:12.179 --> 00:01:13.419
She put the kitten down.

17
00:01:13.439 --> 00:01:14.980
"Okay, Inky.

18
00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:16.881
Let's show everyone what you can do."

19
00:01:17.642 --> 00:01:21.984
Winnie started with a few simple tricks, like having Inky sit and stay.

20
00:01:26.676 --> 00:01:33.018
Then, to Ben's surprise, Winnie showed the judges how Inky could stand and walk on her hind legs.

21
00:01:33.038 --> 00:01:39.020
"Wow!" Ben clapped hard, along with the rest of the crowd.

22
00:01:39.880 --> 00:01:41.420
Winnie blushed and took a bow.

23
00:01:45.921 --> 00:01:48.502
saved her best trick for last," she said.

24
00:01:48.522 --> 00:01:49.963
"Here, Inky."

25
00:01:50.263 --> 00:01:54.604
Winnie patted her left shoulder, and Inky instantly leaped up to sit there.

26
00:01:55.216 --> 00:01:58.538
Then Winnie got on her broom and flew all around the gym.

27
00:02:00.559 --> 00:02:01.780
Everyone clapped again.

28
00:02:01.800 --> 00:02:04.441
"Winnie is super talented!"

29
00:02:04.781 --> 00:02:05.602
Francis said.

30
00:02:05.622 --> 00:02:08.944
"I've never seen a cat do tricks before."

31
00:02:08.964 --> 00:02:10.584
"Me neither!"

32
00:02:10.945 --> 00:02:11.725
a ghoul agreed.

33
00:02:11.745 --> 00:02:14.967
"My cat always does the opposite of what I say."

34
00:02:16.127 --> 00:02:19.889
Winnie landed, took another bow, and then hurried off the stage.

35
00:02:20.590 --> 00:02:22.431
Miss Bungle returned to the microphone.

36
00:02:22.451 --> 00:02:25.176
"Thank you, Winnie," she said.

37
00:02:25.196 --> 00:02:26.977
"That was wonderful!

38
00:02:27.497 --> 00:02:30.538
Our next contestant, Pixel, has a pet pig."

39
00:02:34.259 --> 00:02:36.980
Ben enjoyed watching Priscilla the pig perform.

40
00:02:38.140 --> 00:02:41.961
The pink pig could sit, wave—even fetch objects.

41
00:02:43.482 --> 00:02:47.143
As the audience clapped, Priscilla and Pixel took a bow.

42
00:02:48.203 --> 00:02:49.803
Next it was Mog's turn.

43
00:02:49.823 --> 00:02:57.205
"Everyone, please give a warm welcome to Mog and his dog, Rex-Rex!"

44
00:02:58.206 --> 00:03:00.988
Mog dashed onstage as Winnie sat next to Ben.

45
00:03:01.008 --> 00:03:04.170
"That was awesome!"

46
00:03:04.471 --> 00:03:05.091
Ben said.

47
00:03:05.111 --> 00:03:06.352
"I know."

48
00:03:06.813 --> 00:03:07.693
Winnie smiled.

49
00:03:07.713 --> 00:03:09.215
"Inky was so great!"

50
00:03:10.376 --> 00:03:13.598
"Mog and Rex-Rex are going to do well too," Ben said.

51
00:03:13.618 --> 00:03:15.720
"Mog has been working hard with him."

52
00:03:17.441 --> 00:03:21.196
Onstage, Mog was working with Rex-Rex.

53
00:03:21.216 --> 00:03:22.277
"Now play dead!"

54
00:03:22.978 --> 00:03:28.261
Rex-Rex stood on his hind legs, clutched at his chest, and then fell over backward.

55
00:03:29.062 --> 00:03:30.103
Everyone laughed.

56
00:03:35.086 --> 00:03:37.267
Sid suddenly dropped down beside Ben.

57
00:03:37.287 --> 00:03:39.089
"How's the hunt going?"

58
00:03:39.449 --> 00:03:40.210
Ben asked.

59
00:03:40.230 --> 00:03:41.170
"Any luck?"

60
00:03:42.671 --> 00:03:43.412
"Hunt for what?"

61
00:03:43.752 --> 00:03:44.472
Winnie asked.

62
00:03:44.933 --> 00:03:47.515
Ben quickly explained about the missing owl.

63
00:03:47.535 --> 00:03:51.486
"Wow, Oswald can make himself invisible?"

64
00:03:51.866 --> 00:03:52.486
Winnie said.

65
00:03:52.506 --> 00:03:53.888
"That's an awesome trick!"

66
00:03:54.708 --> 00:03:56.850
"It's more like a bad habit," Ben muttered.

67
00:03:56.870 --> 00:04:01.634
"Waldo's still looking for Oswald," Sid said, "but I got tired.

68
00:04:02.275 --> 00:04:03.716
Plus, I wanted to watch the show."

69
00:04:04.677 --> 00:04:06.838
Inky had been squirming in Winnie's arms.

70
00:04:07.539 --> 00:04:09.881
Spotting Sid, she jumped into his lap.

71
00:04:11.302 --> 00:04:12.123
Sid laughed.

72
00:04:13.164 --> 00:04:14.905
"She didn't like me when she was living with us!

73
00:04:15.365 --> 00:04:16.706
Now I'm her best friend."

74
00:04:17.347 --> 00:04:18.228
Winnie smiled.

75
00:04:18.700 --> 00:04:19.821
"Cats are mysterious.

76
00:04:20.181 --> 00:04:21.081
That's why I like them."

77
00:04:21.821 --> 00:04:23.122
Sid patted Inky's head.

78
00:04:23.142 --> 00:04:24.602
"We could get a cat, Ben."

79
00:04:24.622 --> 00:04:28.304
"No, we can't," Ben said as Inky hissed at him.

80
00:04:28.324 --> 00:04:30.585
"Cats usually hate ghosts."

81
00:04:30.605 --> 00:04:34.827
"Oh!" Winnie pointed at Sid's arm.

82
00:04:34.847 --> 00:04:38.048
"It looks like you are allergic to Inky, Sid."

83
00:04:38.068 --> 00:04:40.929
"What?" Sid sat up to look.

84
00:04:41.369 --> 00:04:45.051
And as he did, Inky sprang into the air—and hovered there!

85
00:04:45.791 --> 00:04:47.892
Winnie stared up at the cat and blinked.

86
00:04:48.400 --> 00:04:50.742
"Inky?" "Come down, Inky!"

87
00:04:51.123 --> 00:04:51.743
Sid said.

88
00:04:54.145 --> 00:04:56.147
Other audience members noticed the kitten.

89
00:04:56.167 --> 00:04:58.950
"Look!" Mayor Hubbletree cried.

90
00:04:58.970 --> 00:05:01.172
"That kitten can fly!"

91
00:05:01.192 --> 00:05:03.093
"Amazing trick!"

92
00:05:03.514 --> 00:05:04.715
a fish monster said.

93
00:05:04.735 --> 00:05:06.336
"It's not a trick!"

94
00:05:06.636 --> 00:05:07.337
Winnie cried.

95
00:05:07.357 --> 00:05:09.579
"Inky can't fly!"

96
00:05:09.879 --> 00:05:12.121
Ben shot upward, trying to grab the kitten.

97
00:05:12.382 --> 00:05:13.923
But Inky zoomed away.

98
00:05:13.943 --> 00:05:17.874
"Inky!" Winnie cried, hopping onto her broom again.

99
00:05:18.354 --> 00:05:20.335
Everyone in the audience oohed and aahed.

100
00:05:22.317 --> 00:05:27.240
"They think this is part of the pet tricks show!"

101
00:05:27.560 --> 00:05:28.401
Ben realized.

102
00:05:28.781 --> 00:05:31.323
He noticed Sid staring at his green spots.

103
00:05:31.343 --> 00:05:33.004
"Are you okay, Sid?"

104
00:05:33.524 --> 00:05:35.165
"Yes." Sid nodded.

105
00:05:35.185 --> 00:05:38.667
"The spots are fading, but I can't understand why I got them."

106
00:05:39.188 --> 00:05:39.888
Ben nodded.

107
00:05:40.429 --> 00:05:44.071
It did seem weird since Sid had never been allergic to Inky before.

108
00:05:46.636 --> 00:05:49.097
Maybe—"Yikes!" Ben whistled loudly twice.

109
00:05:50.378 --> 00:05:56.300
Poof! Oswald appeared in midair, clutching Winnie's kitten in his talons.

110
00:05:56.320 --> 00:06:01.882
"Ooh!" The audience stared in amazement.

111
00:06:02.223 --> 00:06:06.804
Winnie zoomed after the owl, but she couldn't keep up with his swoops and dives.

112
00:06:08.345 --> 00:06:09.566
She shot back to Ben.

113
00:06:09.586 --> 00:06:11.446
"Ben! Do something!

114
00:06:11.747 --> 00:06:14.088
That owl is going to eat Inky!"
